# The committed web bundle is compared byte-for-byte in CI. On Windows a
# CRLF checkout (core.autocrlf=true is the installer default) makes the
# generated HTML/CSS/JS differ from the committed files even though no source
# changed, and the page job reports a stale bundle. Pin the working tree to LF
# for the whole tree the page build reads and writes.
web/** text eol=lf
